---@param radius any
---@param options? any
---@return any table table { npcs, vehicles, props, refused, foreignVehicles, population } where population is "unchanged", "suppressed" or "unavailable", or nil
---@return any reason reason: permission_denied:world.clearArea.foreign, invalid_radius, invalid_position, invalid_options, invalid_bucket, bucket_required_for_population, or a shared zone-module token (invalid_grace)
